pted judgment held that the 147-page record showed Presbytery fulfilled its BCO 31-2 investigatory duty and did not show it erred in judgment when it declined process; the complaint was denied 20-0-1. Concurring opinions raised concerns about committee recusal, record clarity, and exegetical uses of Scripture, but they were separate and did not alter the denial."}},{"id":"bco:18-7--overture:ga42_2014:49","record_id":"overture:ga42_2014:49","type":"Overture","title":"Amend BCO 18-7 Regarding Removal of Candidates and Interns","year":2014,"disposition":"Answered by reference","authority_weight":"low-but-important","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/markdown/ga42_2014.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/markdown/ga42_2014.md","evidence_basis":"multiple","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:18-7--overture:ga42_2014:49:occ-0461b10a9103","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/markdown/ga42_2014.html#ga42-p82","repository_path":"markdown/ga42_2014.md#ga42-p82","locator":{"fragment":"ga42-p82","page":82},"excerpt":"Amend BCO 18-7 Regarding Removal of Candidates and Interns","sources":["disposition_bco,title_subject"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/markdown/ga42_2014.md"},{"id":"bco:18-7--overture:ga42_2014:49:occ-1a453708159a","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/markdown/ga42_2014.html#ga42-p855","repository_path":"markdown/ga42_2014.md#ga42-p855","locator":{"fragment":"ga42-p855","page":855},"excerpt":"…for the candidate’s removal to the candidate and to the Session of his church (BCO 18-7); and **Whereas** Sessions will, at their discretion, request the removal of candidates from the care of the Presbytery; and **Whereas** the Session of his church is not…","sources":["overture_body_text"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/markdown/ga42_2014.md"},{"id":"bco:18-7--overture:ga42_2014:49:occ-b38e2c9487f4"